## 5 · Docker & Compose

Services: **api**, **web**, **db**, **redis**, (optional **nginx**). All commands—including tests—execute inside this stack.

```yaml
version: "3.9"
services:
  db:
    image: postgres:15
    environment:
      POSTGRES_USER: alm
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: alm
      POSTGRES_DB: alm
    volumes: [db:/var/lib/postgresql/data]

  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine

  api:
    build: ./api
    depends_on: [db, redis]
    environment:
      DATABASE_URL: postgresql+asyncpg://alm:alm@db:5432/alm
      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379/0
    ports: ["8000:8000"]

  web:
    build: ./web
    depends_on: [api]
    environment:
      NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL: http://api:8000
    ports: ["3000:3000"]

volumes:
  db:
```

