## 6 · API Specification

| Route            | Verb | Purpose                                   |
| ---------------- | ---- | ----------------------------------------- |
| `/import`        | POST | Pull raw README, parse, persist, validate |
| `/lists/{id}`    | GET  | Return list tree & metadata               |
| `/items`         | CRUD | Manage project entries                    |
| `/categories`    | CRUD | Manage categories / sub‑categories        |
| `/export/{id}`   | GET  | Generate README markdown                  |
| `/validate/{id}` | GET  | Run awesome‑lint & awesome\_bot           |
| `/events`        | GET  | SSE stream of event logs                  |
| `/health`        | GET  | Liveness probe for harness                |

