## 8 · External Functional‑Test Harness

`scripts/functional-test.sh` (executed by CI & local dev)

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail
API=http://localhost:8000

# Wait for health
until curl -sf "$API/health" >/dev/null; do sleep 1; done

# T‑01 Import parity
read -r LID CNT_MD <<< $(curl -sf -X POST "$API/import" \
  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
  -d '{"repoUrl":"https://github.com/krzemienski/awesome-video"}' | jq -r '.listId,.itemCount')
CNT_DB=$(curl -sf "$API/lists/$LID" | jq '.items|length')
[[ "$CNT_MD" == "$CNT_DB" ]]

# T‑02 CRUD, T‑03 Export round‑trip, T‑04 UI smoke …
```

